<p>When you block an attack the shock ripples through your attacker, spreading the force of the Spellblaze in its mind for 5 turns.</p><p>While affected the creature will suffer <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">7%, 14%, 17%, 20%, 22%</acronym> chances to fail using talents and <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10, 30, 45, 58, 70</acronym> reduced physical, mental and spell saves.</p>